  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9b363b48-3941-41b4-9005-f38115f9ef53.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 233px;\"/></p><p>Given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Let potential at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br/>Potential at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The current through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi>kΩ</mi></math> resistor is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>I</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>From the diagram, it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2000</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, from equation (1), it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mA</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
